{"title":"Career Roadmap: Mine Planning Engineer","role":"Mine Planning Engineer","summary":"A Mine Planning Engineer converts geological and resource information into practical mining plans. The role determines where, when, and how material should be extracted, considering geology, mining methods, equipment, production targets, economics, safety, environmental constraints, and mine life.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Mining Engineering"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Develop expertise in mine design, production planning, scheduling, resource evaluation, optimization, and safe, economically viable mining operations"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Mine Planning Engineer converts geological and resource information into practical mining plans. The role determines where, when, and how material should be extracted, considering geology, mining methods, equipment, production targets, economics, safety, environmental constraints, and mine life."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical progression:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. Mining Engineering → Mining Fundamentals → Mine Surveying & Geology → Mine Design → Production Planning → Mine Planning Software → Mining Internship → Junior Mine Planning Engineer → Mine Planning Engineer → Senior Mine Planning Engineer → Mine Planning Manager / Technical Services Manager"}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Engineering + mining fundamentals"},{"text":"Mathematics, physics, geology"},{"text":"Basic mine-study report"},{"text":"Weak engineering fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"Mining methods & surveying"},{"text":"Mine geology, surveying, rock mechanics"},{"text":"Mine-layout exercise"},{"text":"Poor understanding of actual mining operations"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"Mine design & planning"},{"text":"Open-pit/underground design, production planning"},{"text":"Mine design project"},{"text":"Learning software without mining concepts"}],[{"text":"4th Year"},{"text":"Professional planning capability"},{"text":"Scheduling, optimization, economics, software"},{"text":"Mine-planning capstone + internship"},{"text":"No practical mine exposure"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Engineering physics"},{"text":"Engineering chemistry"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"Computer fundamentals"},{"text":"Introduction to mining engineering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Applied mathematics"},{"text":"Engineering mechanics"},{"text":"Geology fundamentals"},{"text":"Basic electrical/mechanical concepts"},{"text":"Introduction to mineral resources"},{"text":"Surveying fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mining geology"},{"text":"Mine surveying"},{"text":"Rock mechanics"},{"text":"Mining machinery"},{"text":"Mining methods"},{"text":"Mine development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Surface mining"},{"text":"Underground mining"},{"text":"Explosives and blasting"},{"text":"Mine ventilation fundamentals"},{"text":"Mineral processing fundamentals"},{"text":"Mining legislation and safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus heavily on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mine design"},{"text":"Open-pit mine planning"},{"text":"Underground mine planning"},{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Equipment selection"},{"text":"Mine scheduling"},{"text":"Haulage systems"},{"text":"Bench design"},{"text":"Pit optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop advanced planning skills:"